cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use UtilityLab in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: UtilityLab
abstract: >-
  UtilityLab is a browser-based tool for designing stated choice experiments.
  It lets researchers define alternatives, attributes and levels, generate or
  import an experimental design, check it with diagnostics, preview each
  choice task as a respondent sees it, and export the choice tasks to survey
  platforms such as Qualtrics and LimeSurvey.
